	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,presentation,"MEDICATION PRIOR TO THIS ADMISSION / PRESENTATION",drug14_herb}', 'definition', 'Herbal or traditional treatment refers to herbs, herbal materials, herbal preparations and finished herbal products, that contain as active ingredients parts of plants, and other knowledge, skills, and practices based on the theories, beliefs, and experiences indigenous to different cultures that are used to treat physical or mental illness.', NULL, 92144),
