	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,daily,"VITAL SIGNS & ASSESSMENTS: Record the value furthest from normal range between 00:00 to 24:00 on day of assessment.",vital_fio2spo2_ltr}', 'definition', 'This refers to the measured fraction of inspired oxygen (FiO2) delivered at the time of the above, lowest oxygen saturation (%), recording.', NULL, 92974),
