	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,daily,"SKIN & MUCOSA ASSESSMENT: Record the information furthest from normal between 00:00 to 24:00 on day of assessment.",lesion_morph}', 'definition', 'This refers to the predominant morphology of the skin rash. Discrete lesions refer to separate, distinct lesions that are not joined to one another. Confluent lesions refer to lesions that are joining or running together.', NULL, 93457),
