	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_strokecva}', 'question', 'Stroke / cerebrovascular accident', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94559),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_strokecva}', 'definition', 'Defined as a sudden loss of neurological function secondary to haemorrhage or ischemia in the brain parenchyma due to a vascular event. Stroke may be a clinical diagnosis, with or without supportive radiological findings.', NULL, 94560),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_strokecva}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94561),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_severeneuro}', 'question', 'Severe neurological disease', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94562),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_severeneuro}', 'definition', 'This refers to various neurological manifestations including meningitis, encephalitis, encephalopathy, acute symptomatic seizures, intracranial haemorrhage or stroke, and Guillain-Barre syndrome (GBS). Meningitis is an inflammatory disease of the leptomeninges, the tissues surrounding the brain and spinal cord, and is defined by an abnormal number of white blood cells in the cerebrospinal fluid (CSF) within an appropriate clinical context and with or without supportive radiological findings. Encephalitis refers to inflammation of the brain. In comparison with meningitis, in encephalitis, abnormalities in brain function are expected, including altered mental status, motor or sensory deficits, altered behaviour and personality changes, and speech or movement disorders. It is defined by an altered mental status lasting ?24 hours along with two of the following criteria: documented fever >/= 38°C (100.4°F); white blood cell count (WBC) in cerebrospinal fluid (CSF) >/= 5  cells/mm^3; generalized or partial seizures not fully attributable to a preexisting seizure disorder; new onset of focal neurological findings; presence of compatible acute lesion on neuroimaging; abnormality on electroencephalography that is consistent with encephalitis and not attributable to another cause. As outlined by the 2013 International Encephalitis Consortium. Seizures are defined as an intermittent abnormality of nervous system physiology characterised by a transient occurrence of sudden, violent, irregular movement of the body, caused by involuntary contraction of muscles due to abnormal excessive or synchronous neuronal activity in the brain. An established history of epilepsy is not required. Stroke refers to a sudden loss of neurological function secondary to haemorrhage or ischemia in the brain parenchyma due to a vascular event. Stroke may be a clinical diagnosis, with or without supportive radiological findings. Intracranial haemorrhage refers to haemorrhage/bleeding occurring within the skull. Intracranial haemorrhage encompasses four broad types of haemorrhage: epidural haemorrhage, subdural haemorrhage, subarachnoid haemorrhage, and intraparenchymal haemorrhage. Guillain-Barre syndrome refers to a rapidly progressive autoimmune disorder of the peripheral nervous system characterized by limb paraesthesia, areflexia, and generalized muscle weakness or paralysis that often begins in the legs and spreads to the arms, torso, and face. Required features include progressive weakness of the arms and/or legs, ranging from minimal weakness of the legs to total paralysis of all four limbs, and including the trunk, bulbar and facial muscles, and external ophthalmoplegia; and areflexia or decreased deep tendon reflexes in weak limbs. Supportive features include symptom progression over days to four weeks; Relatively symmetric, bilateral symptoms; Pain in the trunk or limbs; Cranial nerve symptoms or signs; Autonomic dysfunction; Sensory dysfunction that is mild; No fever at symptom onset; CSF with elevated protein and normal to mildly elevated leukocyte count (usually <5 cells/mm3); Electrodiagnostic abnormalities consistent with GBS; Recovery starting two to four weeks after progression halts.', NULL, 94563),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_severeneuro}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94564),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_encephalopathy}', 'question', 'Encephalopathy', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94565),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cvs}', 'definition', 'Defined as any complications of the cardiovascular system', NULL, 94587),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{Lists,conditions,Comorbidities,Hyperthyroidism}', 'listItem', 'Hyperthyroidism', NULL, 95328),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_encephalopathy}', 'definition', 'Encephalopathy broadly refers brain dysfunction which may be due to a functional and / or structural disorder caused by a vareity of aetiologies, including diseases of other organ systems (e.g. liver disease, kidney disease), medications, chemicals, and injuries. It presents with a range of symptoms including altered mental status, confusion, memory loss, and behavioral changes', NULL, 94566),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_encephalopathy}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94567),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_seizure}', 'question', 'Seizure', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94568),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_seizure}', 'definition', 'Defined as an intermittent abnormality of nervous system physiology characterised by a transient occurrence of sudden, violent, irregular movement of the body, caused by involuntary contraction of muscles due to abnormal excessive or synchronous neuronal activity in the brain. An established history of epilepsy is not required.', NULL, 94569),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_seizure}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94570),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_focalneuro}', 'question', 'Focal neurological signs', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94571),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_focalneuro}', 'definition', 'Defined as as impairments of nerve, spinal cord, or brain function that affect a specific region of the body, e.g. weakness in the left arm, the right leg, paresis, or plegia, identified in neurological examination.', NULL, 94572),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_focalneuro}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94573),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_encephalitis}', 'question', 'Encephalitis', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94574),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_encephalitis}', 'definition', 'Encephalitis refers to inflammation of the brain. It is defined by an altered mental status lasting greater or equal to 24 hours along with two of the following criteria: documented fever greater or equal to 38° C (100.4°F); white blood cell count (WBC) in cerebrospinal fluid (CSF) greater or equal to 5/mm³; generalized or partial seizures not fully attributable to a preexisting seizure disorder; new onset of focal neurological findings; presence of compatible acute lesion on neuroimaging; abnormality on electroencephalography that is consistent with encephalitis and not attributable to another cause. As outlined by the 2013 International Encephalitis Consortium.', NULL, 94575),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_encephalitis}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94576),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_meningitis}', 'question', 'Meningitis', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94577),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_meningitis}', 'definition', 'Meningitis is defined by an abnormal number of white blood cells in the cerebrospinal fluid (CSF) within an appropriate clinical context and with or without supportive radiological findings.', NULL, 94578),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_meningitis}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94579),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_gbs}', 'question', 'Guillain-Barre syndrome (GBS)', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94580),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_gbs}', 'definition', 'Refers to a rapidly progressive autoimmune disorder of the peripheral nervous system characterized by limb paresthesias, areflexia, and generalized muscle weakness or paralysis that often begins in the legs and spreads to the arms, torso, and face. ', NULL, 94581),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_gbs}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94582),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cnsinf}', 'question', 'CNS infection', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94583),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cnsinf}', 'definition', 'This refers to An infectious process that affects the brain and/or spinal cord, may include encephalitis, poliomyelitis, arachnoiditis, and meningitis.', NULL, 94584),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cnsinf}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94585),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cvs}', 'question', 'Cardiovascular complications', NULL, 94586),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{Lists,conditions,Comorbidities,Hypothyroidism}', 'listItem', 'Hypothyroidism', NULL, 95329),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cvs}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94588),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_myocardial}', 'question', 'Myocardial infarction', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94589),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_myocardial}', 'definition', 'Defined as myocardial ischaemia leading to injury/necrosis, diagnosed by clinical findings, altered electrocardiography and elevated cardiac enzymes.', NULL, 94590),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_myocardial}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94591),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cardiacisc}', 'question', 'Cardiac ischaemia', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94592),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cardiacisc}', 'definition', 'Defined as diminished blood and oxygen supply to the heart muscle as indicated by typical symptomatology (e.g. chest pain) and confirmed by an electrocardiogram (showing ischaemic changes, e.g. ST depression or elevation) and/or cardiac enzyme elevation (e.g. raised troponin I).', NULL, 94593),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cardiacisc}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94594),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_endocardit}', 'question', 'Endocarditis', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94595),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_endocardit}', 'definition', 'This refers to an inflammation of the endocardium (inner lining of the heart). It is often caused by a primary disorder or microorganisms including bacteria, viruses, fungi, and rickettsiae Diagnosis of infective endocarditis is according to modified Duke criteria, using evidence from microbiological results, echocardiogram and clinical signs.', NULL, 94596),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_endocardit}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94597),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cardiomyop}', 'question', 'Cardiomyopathy', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94598),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cardiomyop}', 'definition', 'This refers to structural and functional disorders of myocardium commonly diagnosed by echocardiography. Cardiomyopathy can be primary (genetic) or secondary (e.g. following myocardial infarction).', NULL, 94599),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cardiomyop}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94600),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_chf}', 'question', 'Congestive heart failure', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94601),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_chf}', 'definition', 'Defined as failure of the heart to pump a sufficient amount of blood to meet the needs of the body tissues, resulting in tissue congestion and oedema. Signs and symptoms include shortness of breath, pitting oedema, enlarged tender liver, engorged neck veins, and pulmonary rales. There are many ways to assess cardiac function (e.g. echocardiography, right heart catheterization, functional testing and supportive biochemical tests). However, there is no diagnostic test for heart failure, since it is largely a clinical diagnosis that is based upon a careful history and physical examination.', NULL, 94602),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_chf}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94603),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cardiarrhy}', 'question', 'Cardiac arrhythmia', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94604),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cardiarrhy}', 'definition', 'Refers to any variation from the normal rate or rhythm (which may include the origin of the impulse and/or its subsequent propagation) in the heart, confirmed by electrocardiographic monitoring.', NULL, 94605),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cardiarrhy}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94606),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cardiarrest}', 'question', 'Cardiac arrest', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94607),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cardiarrest}', 'definition', 'Cardiopulmonary arrest or circulatory arrest is defined as the sudden cessation of cardiac activity in an individual who becomes unresponsive, without normal breathing and no signs of circulation.', NULL, 94608),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cardiarrest}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94609),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_myocarditis}', 'question', 'Myocarditis', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94610),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_myocarditis}', 'definition', 'This refers to inflammation of the muscle tissue of the heart (myocarditis) / an inflammatory process affecting the pericardium (pericarditis). It may be diagnosed clinically, with assistance from an echocardiogram, EKG, laboratory or radiological tests.', NULL, 94611),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_myocarditis}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94612),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_pericarditis}', 'question', 'Pericarditis', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94613),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_pericarditis}', 'definition', 'This refers to inflammation of the muscle tissue of the heart (myocarditis) / an inflammatory process affecting the pericardium (pericarditis). It may be diagnosed clinically, with assistance from an echocardiogram, EKG, laboratory or radiological tests.', NULL, 94614),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_pericarditis}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94615),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_respiratory}', 'question', 'Respiratory complications', NULL, 94616),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_respiratory}', 'definition', 'Defined as any complications of the respiratory system', NULL, 94617),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_respiratory}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94618),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_pneum}', 'question', 'Pneumonia / pneumonitis', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94619),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_pneum}', 'definition', 'Pneumonia is an infection of one or both lungs that causes the air sacs to become inflamed and fill with fluid or pus, making it difficult to breathe. This inflammation is commonly caused by bacteria, viruses, or fungi and can result in symptoms such as cough, fever, chills, and shortness of breath.', NULL, 94620),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_pneum}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94621),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_pneum_etio}', 'question', 'Is the etiological pathogen different to the primary diagnosis', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94622),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_pneum_etio}', 'definition', 'Pneumonia is an infection of one or both lungs that causes the air sacs to become inflamed and fill with fluid or pus, making it difficult to breathe. This inflammation is commonly caused by bacteria, viruses, or fungi and can result in symptoms such as cough, fever, chills, and shortness of breath.', NULL, 94623),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_pneum_etio}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94624),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_pneum_type}', 'question', 'Etiology of pneumonia', '{Viral,Bacterial,Fungal}', 94625),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_pneum_type}', 'definition', 'Pneumonia is an infection of one or both lungs that causes the air sacs to become inflamed and fill with fluid or pus, making it difficult to breathe. This inflammation is commonly caused by bacteria, viruses, or fungi and can result in symptoms such as cough, fever, chills, and shortness of breath.', NULL, 94626),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_pneum_type}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'' if the pathogen causing pneumonia as a complication is different from the pathogen of interest at admission.', NULL, 94627),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', NULL, 'answerOption', 'Viral', NULL, 94628),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', NULL, 'answerOption', 'Bacterial', NULL, 94629),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', NULL, 'answerOption', 'Fungal', NULL, 94630),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_pneum_acq}', 'question', 'Acquisition setting of pneumonia', '{"Community acquired","Hospital acquired","Ventilator acquired",Unknown}', 94631),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_pneum_acq}', 'definition', 'This refers to the setting in which the pneumonia was acquired: community, hospital, ventilator-associated, or unknown.', NULL, 94632),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', NULL, 'answerOption', 'Community acquired', NULL, 94633),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', NULL, 'answerOption', 'Hospital acquired', NULL, 94634),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', NULL, 'answerOption', 'Ventilator acquired', NULL, 94635),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_pneumothor}', 'question', 'Pneumothorax', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94636),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_sys}', 'question', 'Systemic complication', NULL, 94780),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_pneumothor}', 'definition', 'Defined as the abnormal presence of air in the pleural cavity (between the lungs and the chest wall), causing collapse of the lung. It may be diagnosed clinically, usually with radiological confirmation.', NULL, 94637),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_pneumothor}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94638),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_pleuraleff}', 'question', 'Pleural effusion', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94639),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_pleuraleff}', 'definition', 'Defined as increased amounts of fluid within the pleural cavity. Symptoms include shortness of breath, cough, and chest pain. It is usually caused by lung infections, congestive heart failure, pleural and lung tumours, connective tissue disorders, and trauma. It may be diagnosed clinically, with or without radiological or interventional confirmation.', NULL, 94640),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_pleuraleff}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94641),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_copneumoni}', 'question', 'Cryptogenic organising pneumonia (COP)', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94642),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_copneumoni}', 'definition', 'This refers to an idiopathic diffuse interstitial lung disease, diagnosed radiologically (multiple consolidative or ground glass opacities) or histologically (granulation tissue and chronic inflammatory infiltrate in alveoli). Formerly known as bronchiolitis obliterans organizing pneumonia (BOOP).', NULL, 94643),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_copneumoni}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94644),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_bronchioli}', 'question', 'Bronchiolitis', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94645),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_bronchioli}', 'definition', 'This refers to Inflammation of the bronchioles. In adults, bronchiolitis is a general term used to describe a nonspecific Inflammation of the bronchioles characterized by swelling of the bronchioles and mucus accumulation. It is usually caused by the respiratory syncytial virus and affects children. Signs and symptoms include coughing, wheezing, and shortness of breath. In the majority of cases, open or thoracoscopic lung biopsy is required to make a definitive diagnosis, although tissue confirmation may not be necessary in patients with a clear predisposition and typical radiological findings. In infants and children, bronchiolitis is defined as an illness in children <2 years of age, characterized by wheezing and airway obstruction due to primary infection or reinfection with a viral or bacterial pathogen, resulting in inflammation of the small airways/bronchioles. This is a clinical diagnosis, generally in children < 2 years old.', NULL, 94646),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_bronchioli}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94647),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_ards}', 'question', 'Acute Respiratory Distress Syndrome (ARDS)', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94648),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_ards}', 'definition', 'Acute respiratory distress syndrome (ARDS) is a non-cardiogenic pulmonary oedema and diffuse lung inflammation syndrome that often complicates critical illness. Diagnosis of ARDS is based on fulfilling three criteria: a) Acute onset (within 1 week) b) Bilateral opacities on chest radiography or computed tomography (CT), or bilateral B lines and/or consolidations on ultrasound not fully explained by effusions, atelectasis, or nodules/masses. c)PaO2/FiO2 (arterial to inspired oxygen) ratio of ?300 or SpO2/FiO2 (pulse oximetric saturation to inspired oxygen) ratio of ?315. ', NULL, 94649),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_ards}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94650),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_git}', 'question', 'Gastrointestinal complications', NULL, 94651),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_git}', 'definition', 'Defined as any complications of the gastrointestinal system', NULL, 94652),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_git}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94653),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_ascite}', 'question', 'Ascites', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94654),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_ascite}', 'definition', 'This refers to pathological increase in amount of fluid in the abdominal cavity (ascites). It may be diagnosed clinically, with or without radiological or interventional confirmation. Symptoms associated with ascites include increasing abdominal girth, abdominal discomfort and distension, shortness of breath.', NULL, 94655),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_ascite}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94656),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_pancreatit}', 'question', 'Pancreatitis', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94657),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_pancreatit}', 'definition', 'This refers to acute inflammation of the pancreas. Acute pancreatitis is diagnosed clinically with supporting biochemical (e.g serum amylase or serum lipase) and/or radiological and/or histological evidence. All evidence should be considered together, since no single feature is diagnostic of acute pancreatitis.', NULL, 94658),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_pancreatit}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94659),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_acutehepat}', 'question', 'Acute hepatitis', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94660),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_acutehepat}', 'definition', 'This refers to acute hepatic injury from inflammation resulting in fever, abdominal pain, jaundice accompanied with increased liver function tests (serum alanine transaminase (ALT) and / or aspartate transaminase (AST) activity). Etiologies include viral hepatitis, drugs, toxins, and autoimmune disorders.', NULL, 94661),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_acutehepat}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94662),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_severeliver}', 'question', 'Severe liver disease (new onset)', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94663),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_severeliver}', 'definition', 'Defined as new onset cirrhosis and portal hypertension with variceal bleeding, ascites, jaundice or status post liver transplantation.', NULL, 94664),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_severeliver}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94665),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_hepaticenc}', 'question', 'Hepatic encephalopathy (any grade)', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94666),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_hepaticenc}', 'definition', 'This refers to a neuropsychiatric syndrome caused by advanced liver insufficiency and/or portosystemic shunt without evidence of other primary neurological disease. Clinical features include lethargy; confusion (can progress to coma); asterixis; pathologic nystagmus; brisk oculovestibular reflexes; decorticate and decerebrate posturing; muscle spasticity; and bilateral extensor plantar reflexes.', NULL, 94667),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_hepaticenc}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94668),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_jaundice}', 'question', 'Jaundice', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94669),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_jaundice}', 'definition', 'This refers to a clinical manifestation of hyperbilirubinemia, characterized by the yellowish staining of the skin, mucous membrane and/or sclera. ', NULL, 94670),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_jaundice}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94671),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_liverdysfu}', 'question', 'Liver dysfunction', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94672),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_liverdysfu}', 'definition', 'This refers to a finding that indicates abnormal liver function, may refer to any of the following: Jaundice; Hyperbilirubinemia (blood bilirubin level twice the upper limit of the normal range); An increase in alanine transaminase (ALT) or aspartate transaminase (AST) that is twice the upper limit of the normal range.', NULL, 94673),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_liverdysfu}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94674),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_heme}', 'question', 'Haematological complications', NULL, 94675),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_heme}', 'definition', 'Defined as any complications of the haematological system', NULL, 94676),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_heme}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94677),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_thrombemb}', 'question', 'Thromboembolism', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94678),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_thrombemb}', 'definition', 'Defined as the occlusion of the lumen of a blood vessel by a thrombus that has migrated from a distal site via the blood stream.', NULL, 94679),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_thrombemb}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94680),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_thrombemb_pe}', 'question', 'Pulmonary embolism (PE)', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94681),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_thrombemb_pe}', 'definition', 'Defined as the occlusion of a pulmonary artery by thrombus, air or fat. Physician diagnosis based on clinical signs and/or radiological tests (e.g. computed tomographic pulmonary angiography and/or ventilation/perfusion scanning).', NULL, 94682),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_thrombemb_pe}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94683),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_thrombemb_dvt}', 'question', 'Deep vein thrombosis (DVT)', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94684),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_thrombemb_dvt}', 'definition', 'Defined as the presence of a blood clot in a deep vein, predominantly in the lower extremity, but may include the pelvis or upper extremity. Symptoms may include pain, swelling, warmth, and redness in the affected area. Physician diagnosis based on clinical signs and/or appropriate diagnostic imaging e.g. ultrasonography.', NULL, 94685),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_thrombemb_dvt}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94686),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_thrombemb_oth}', 'question', 'Other thromboembolism (not PE or DVT)', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94687),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_thrombemb_oth}', 'definition', 'This refers to thromboembolic diagnoses not specified above.', NULL, 94688),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_thrombemb_oth}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94689),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_thrombemb_spec}', 'question', 'Specify other thromboembolism', NULL, 94690),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_thrombemb_spec}', 'definition', 'This refers to the other thromboembolic diagnoses not specified above.', NULL, 94691),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_thrombemb_spec}', 'completionGuide', 'If ''Other'', write the other thromboembolic diagnoses the patient experienced at any time during hospitalisation. ', NULL, 94692),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_severebleed}', 'question', 'Severe bleeding (requiring intervention)', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94693),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_severebleed}', 'definition', 'Defined as bleeding resulting in haemodynamic compromise necessitating intervention, namely transfusion. This includes World Health Organisation (WHO) Bleeding Scale grade 3 or 4.', NULL, 94694),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_severebleed}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94695),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_severebleed_site}', 'question', 'Severe bleeding site(s)', '{Skin,Petechiae,Nose,Gums,"GI tract","Urinary tract",Vagina,Other(s),Unknown}', 94696),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_severebleed_site}', 'definition', 'This refers to the location of bleeding/haemorrhage site(s). Petechiae refer to small reddish or purplish spots in skin or mucous membrane as a result of localised haemorrhage. Nose bleeding refers to haemorrhage localized in the nose. Gum bleeding refers to haemorrhage affecting the gingiva. Gastrointestinal (GI) bleeding refers to haemorrhage in any segment of the gastrointestinal tract from oesophagus to rectum. Urinary tract bleeding refers to haemorrhage originating from any part of the urinary system. Vaginal bleeding refers to haemorrhage originating from vagina, unrelated to normal menstruation.', NULL, 94697),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_severebleed_site}', 'completionGuide', 'Select the most appropriate option(s) corresponding to the location of bleeding/haemorrhage site(s).', NULL, 94698),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', NULL, 'answerOption', 'Petechiae', NULL, 94699),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', NULL, 'answerOption', 'Nose', NULL, 94700),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', NULL, 'answerOption', 'Gums', NULL, 94701),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', NULL, 'answerOption', 'GI tract', NULL, 94702),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', NULL, 'answerOption', 'Vagina', NULL, 94703),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', NULL, 'answerOption', 'Other(s)', NULL, 94704),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_severebleed_site_oth}', 'question', 'Specify other site(s) of bleeding', NULL, 94705),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_severebleed_site_oth}', 'definition', 'This refers to the location of bleeding/haemorrhage site(s).', NULL, 94706),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{Lists,conditions,Comorbidities,Immunosuppression}', 'listItem', 'Immunosuppression', NULL, 95330),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_severebleed_site_oth}', 'completionGuide', 'If ''Other'', Write the other location of site(s) where the patient has experienced bleeding/haemorrhage at any time from onset of this illness and presentation or admission.', NULL, 94707),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_anaemia}', 'question', 'Anaemia', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94708),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_anaemia}', 'definition', 'Defined as a reduction in the number of red blood cells, the amount of haemoglobin, and/or the volume of packed red blood cells. Signs and symptoms of anaemia may include pallor of the skin and mucous membranes, shortness of breath, palpitations of the heart, soft systolic murmurs, lethargy, and fatigability. The World Health Organization thresholds are used for defining anaemia, in adult males aged over 15 years anaemia is defined by a haemoglobin <130g/L (<8.1mmol/L); for non-pregnant females aged over 15 years thresholds are <120g/L (<7.4mmol/L), for children aged under 5 years and pregnant women as a haemoglobin <110 g/L (6.8 mmol/L)', NULL, 94709),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_anaemia}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94710),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_coagulatio}', 'question', 'Coagulation disorder / DIC', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94711),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_coagulatio}', 'definition', 'Coagulopathy (bleeding disorder) is defined as a condition in which there is a deviation from or interruption of the normal coagulation properties of the blood (normal blood clotting is disrupted). Disseminated intravascular coagulation (DIC) is a specific type of coagulopathy which blood starts to coagulate throughout the whole body. Acute DIC is confirmed by demonstrating increased thrombin generation (e.g. decreased fibrinogen) and increased fibrinolysis (e.g. elevated fibrin degradation products and D-dimer). The diagnosis of chronic DIC may be largely based upon evidence of microangiopathy on the blood film and increased levels of fibrin degradation products and particularly D-dimer.', NULL, 94712),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_coagulatio}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94713),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_renalgut}', 'question', 'Renal/genitourinary complications', NULL, 94714),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_renalgut}', 'definition', 'Defined as any complications of the renal/genitourinary system', NULL, 94715),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_renalgut}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94716),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_acuterenal}', 'question', 'Acute renal injury / acute renal failure', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94717),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_acuterenal}', 'definition', 'Acute kidney injury is defined when one of the following criteria is met: Serum creatinine rises by >= 26umol/L or 0.3mg/dL within 48 hours; or serum creatinine rises >= 1.5 fold from the reference value, which is known or presumed to have occurred within the prior 7 days; or urine output is <0.5ml/kg/hr for >6 consecutive hours.', NULL, 94718),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_acuterenal}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94719),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_uti}', 'question', 'Urinary tract infection', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94720),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_uti}', 'definition', 'This refers to inflammatory responses of the epithelium of the urinary tract to microbial invasions. They are often bacterial infections with associated bacteruria and pyuria.', NULL, 94721),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_uti}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94722),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_urineret}', 'question', 'Urinary retention', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94723),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_urineret}', 'definition', 'This refers to accumulation of urine within the bladder because of the inability to urinate.', NULL, 94724),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_urineret}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94725),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_urineret_spec}', 'question', 'please specify', NULL, 94726),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_urineret_spec}', 'definition', 'This refers to accumulation of urine within the bladder because of the inability to urinate.', NULL, 94727),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_urineret_spec}', 'completionGuide', 'If ''Yes'', please specify', NULL, 94728),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_ent}', 'question', 'Ear/Nose/Throat complications', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94729),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_ent}', 'definition', 'Defined as any complications of the ear / nose and throat system', NULL, 94730),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_ent}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94731),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_deepneck}', 'question', 'Deep neck space infections', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94732),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_deepneck}', 'definition', 'This refers to an infection of the deep fascial planes in the neck.', NULL, 94733),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_deepneck}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94734),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_msk}', 'question', 'Musculoskeletal complication', NULL, 94735),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_msk}', 'definition', 'Defined as any complications of the musculoskeletal system', NULL, 94736),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_msk}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94737),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_rhabdomyol}', 'question', 'Rhabdomyolysis', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94738),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_rhabdomyol}', 'definition', 'Rhabdomyolysis is a syndrome characterised by muscle necrosis and the release of myoglobin into the blood, resulting from muscle injury. Diagnosis is made in a patient with either an acute neuromuscular illness or dark urine without other symptoms, plus a marked acute elevation in creatine kinase. The creatine kinase is typically at least five times the upper limit of normal (there is no diagnostic threshold to establish the diagnosis, however). Muscle biopsy, electromyography, radiological imaging and the presence of myoglobinuria are not required for the diagnosis.', NULL, 94739),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_rhabdomyol}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94740),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_myositis}', 'question', 'Myositis', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94741),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_myositis}', 'definition', 'Myositis is defined as an inflammatory process affecting the skeletal muscles. Causes include infections, injuries, and autoimmune disorders. It may be a clinical diagnosis with supporting evidence from laboratory tests e.g. elevated serum creatine kinase; histological confirmation is not required to make the diagnosis. Myositis can occur without subsequent progression to rhabdomyolysis.', NULL, 94742),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_myositis}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94743),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_skin}', 'question', 'Skin complication', NULL, 94744),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_skin}', 'definition', 'Defined as any complications of the skin', NULL, 94745),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_skin}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94746),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cellulitis}', 'question', 'Cellulitis', '{Yes,No,Unknown}', 94747),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cellulitis}', 'definition', 'Defined as an acute, diffuse, and suppurative inflammation of loose connective tissue, particularly the deep subcutaneous tissues, and sometimes muscle, which is most commonly seen as a result of infection. Diagnosis is made on clinical signs and symptoms, it can be supported by microbiological evidence.', NULL, 94748),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cellulitis}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94749),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cellulitis_site}', 'question', 'Site(s) of cellulitis', '{Skin,Nose,Gums,"GI tract","Urinary tract",Vagina,Unknown,Other}', 94750),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cellulitis_site}', 'definition', 'This refers to the site(s) in which cellulitis was identified.', NULL, 94751),
	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"COMPLICATIONS: Experienced at any time from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",compl_cornealstroma}', 'completionGuide', 'Indicate ''Yes'', if the patient experienced this at any time during hospitalisation.', NULL, 94779),
