	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,outcome,"RESPIRATORY SUPPORT: Record all respiratory interventions given or prescribed from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",inter_prone}', 'definition', 'Prone positioning refers to the act of having the patient lying in the prone position to assist ventilation. This includes both invasive ventilation/intubated patients and non-intubated or self-ventilating patients. ', NULL, 94995),
