	('2026-03-18 11:00:12.956231+00', '{ARC,follow_up,"BARTHEL INDEX SCORE",follow_barthel}', 'definition', 'Following questions are used to calculate the  Barthel Index score: The Barthel Index for Activities of Daily Living is an ordinal scale which measures a person''s ability to complete activities of daily living/', NULL, 95237),
