	('2026-03-24 08:18:45.374493+00', '{ARC,presentation,"MEDICATION PREVIOUS 7-DAYS",drug7_ivfluid_vol2}', 'definition', 'Parenteral or intravenous (IV) fluid is prescribed as a replacement of fluid, electrolytes, calories, vitamins, and other nutritional substances. Intravenous fluids may be used for rehydration, maintenance requirements or resuscitation.', NULL, 98077),
