	('2026-03-24 08:18:45.374493+00', '{ARC,outcome,"INTERVENTIONS: Record interventions given or prescribed from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",inter_nivent}', 'definition', 'Non-invasive respiratory support or ventilation (NIV) refers to the provision of ventilatory support through the patient''s upper airway using a mask or similar device. It includes high-flow nasal cannula, continuous positive airway pressure (CPAP) and bilevel positive airway pressure (BPAP).', NULL, 99236),
