	('2026-03-24 08:18:45.374493+00', '{ARC,outcome,"INTERVENTIONS: Record interventions given or prescribed from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",inter_ecmo}', 'definition', 'The two main types of Extracorporeal Membrane Oxygenation (ECMO), also called Extracorporeal life support (ECLS), are veno-venous (venous-venous), which is used to support the lungs and veno-arterial (venous-arterial), which is used to support the lungs and heart.', NULL, 99246),
