	('2026-03-24 08:40:04.3022+00', '{ARC,adsym_jaund}', 'definition', 'Defined as a clinical manifestation of hyperbilirubinemia, characterized by the yellowish staining of the skin, mucous membrane and/or sclera. ', NULL, 100382),
