	('2026-03-24 08:40:04.3022+00', '{ARC,labs_ferritin_ngml}', 'definition', 'Ferritin refers to an iron protein complex, containing up to 23% iron, formed by the union of ferric iron with apoferritin; it is found in the intestinal mucosa, spleen, bone marrow, reticulocytes, and liver, and regulates iron storage and transport from the intestinal lumen to plasma.', NULL, 101373),
