	('2026-04-20 13:35:28.186514+00', '{ARC,presentation,"INCLUSION CRITERIA",inclu_case}', 'definition', 'Confirmed refers to a case that is laboratory confirmed and may fulfil the clinical criteria as described in the case definition. Probable refers to a clinically compatible illness that is epidemiologically linked to a confirmed case without laboratory confirmation of infection with pathogen of interest. Suspected refers to a clinically compatible illness without epidemiological link or laboratory confirmation. Discarded refers to a patient with a negative laboratory test and has failed to fulfil the criteria for a suspect, probable or confirmed case.', NULL, 102193),
