	('2026-04-20 13:35:28.186514+00', '{ARC,neonate,"NEWBORN OUTCOMES",nborn_ga}', 'definition', 'This refers to the gestational age of the foetus (written in completed weeks). It can be calculated from the woman''s last menstrual period (LMP) or calculated using the best obstetrical estimated due date (EDD) based on the following formula: Gestational Age = (28 - (EDD - Reference Date)) / 7. The reference date is the date in which you are trying to determine the gestational age.', NULL, 103355),
