	('2026-06-22 13:22:38.600013+00', '{ARC,presentation,"MEDICATION PRIOR TO THIS ADMISSION / PRESENTATION",drug14_blood_plate}', 'definition', 'Platelets refers to the transfer of blood platelets from a donor to a recipient or reinfusion to the donor.', NULL, 103757),
