	('2026-08-24 03:43:50.004197+00', '{ARC,daily,"SYMPTOMS: Indicate if experienced between 00:00 to 24:00 on day of assessment.",sympt_hiccups}', 'definition', 'This refers to a quick, involuntary contraction of the diaphragm, which leads to inspiration and an audible, reflexive closure of the vocal cords. ', NULL, 104635),
