	('2026-08-24 03:43:50.004197+00', '{ARC,outcome,"INTERVENTIONS: Record interventions given or prescribed from day of presentation to day of discharge / outcome.",inter_vteproph}', 'definition', 'This refers to prophylaxis for venous thromboembolism. Interventions are include general measures (e.g., early mobilization, exercise), mechanical methods (e.g., graduated compression stockings, intermittent pneumatic compression), and pharmacological agents (e.g., low-molecular-weight heparin, unfractionated heparin, DOACs). The chosen regimen depends on the patient''s underlying risk for VTE and their estimated risk of bleeding.', NULL, 104785),
